the first level is of size 1.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Process the current level</strong>: For each node at this level,=
 pop it from the queue and add its children to the queue.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p>After processing all nodes of the current level, the queue contains all =
the nodes of the next level. Repeat steps 1 and 2 to process the next level=
. When the queue is empty, all levels have been processed.</p>
